Description: NextDesk: a ChromeOS-style Nextcloud desktop
 A minimal Xfce (X11) session that looks like ChromeOS: a bottom shelf with
 the Nextcloud web apps pinned, an app launcher and system tray, and nothing
 else. The Nextcloud apps are installed by the browser as web apps (PWAs)
 through the WebAppInstallForceList policy, with the title bar drawn over the
 page (window-controls-overlay), which needs X11.
 .
 Configure the Nextcloud server with: nextdesk-config --url https://cloud.example.com
